      "start_ms": 2120,
      "end_ms": 3320,
      "text": "完全是就是不干活"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "start_ms": 3320,
      "end_ms": 4220,
      "text": "一分钱没有"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "start_ms": 4220,
      "end_ms": 7040,
      "text": "我没有钱的好吧"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "start_ms": 7770,
      "end_ms": 9450,
      "text": "OK来讲到这边啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "start_ms": 11010,
      "end_ms": 12930,
      "text": "讲到这里"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "start_ms": 18180,
      "end_ms": 18940,
      "text": "goodbye啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "start_ms": 18940,
      "end_ms": 20260,
      "text": "拜拜啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "start_ms": 20260,
      "end_ms": 21500,
      "text": "我也我也去休息了啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "start_ms": 21500,
      "end_ms": 22570,
      "text": "good bye拜拜"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "start_ms": 22570,
      "end_ms": 25040,
      "text": "然后那个国庆期间我可能不不会直播啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "start_ms": 25040,
      "end_ms": 26480,
      "text": "我可能会发点视频"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "start_ms": 26480,
      "end_ms": 27400,
      "text": "但是我不会播啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "start_ms": 27400,
      "end_ms": 29660,
      "text": "你们自己好好就是体验这个假期吧"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "start_ms": 29660,
      "end_ms": 32380,
      "text": "多关注我们的那个俱乐部的直播"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15,
      "start_ms": 32380,
      "end_ms": 34020,
      "text": "直播一直会有活动呢"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 16,
      "start_ms": 34020,
      "end_ms": 35020,
      "text": "呃有哪些活动"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 17,
      "start_ms": 35020,
      "end_ms": 38220,
      "text": "我就我为了避免有些人那个断章取义啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 18,
      "start_ms": 38220,
      "end_ms": 40730,
      "text": "我就不把这个活动的截图给你们发出来了"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 19,
      "start_ms": 40730,
      "end_ms": 42830,
      "text": "呃我就念一下吧"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 20,
      "start_ms": 42830,
      "end_ms": 45080,
      "text": "呃俱乐部会有那个"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 21,
      "start_ms": 47430,
      "end_ms": 51530,
      "text": "第一天会有那个知青俱乐部会种树苗的活动"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 22,
      "start_ms": 51530,
      "end_ms": 54430,
      "text": "然后呢还有就是这都是例行活动"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 23,
      "start_ms": 54430,
      "end_ms": 56820,
      "text": "一直有的city walk活动啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 24,
      "start_ms": 56820,
      "end_ms": 58160,
      "text": "收那个20块钱项目费"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 25,
      "start_ms": 58160,
      "end_ms": 59260,
      "text": "ct work20块钱"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 26,
      "start_ms": 59260,
      "end_ms": 60300,
      "text": "你能信"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 27,
      "start_ms": 60300,
      "end_ms": 62420,
      "text": "小红书上city walk80块钱一个人"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 28,
      "start_ms": 62420,
      "end_ms": 63560,
      "text": "我们他妈收20块钱"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 29,
      "start_ms": 65399,
      "end_ms": 68430,
      "text": "而且是甚至是你不是会员"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 30,
      "start_ms": 68430,
      "end_ms": 70630,
      "text": "有好多这个小红书上引流过来的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 31,
      "start_ms": 70630,
      "end_ms": 71970,
      "text": "20块钱也带他了"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 32,
      "start_ms": 71970,
      "end_ms": 75150,
      "text": "20块钱一个人的ct work包接送"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 33,
      "start_ms": 75150,
      "end_ms": 77240,
      "text": "饮饮水和小吃"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 34,
      "start_ms": 77240,
      "end_ms": 78680,
      "text": "你能他妈的逼的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 35,
      "start_ms": 78680,
      "end_ms": 80000,
      "text": "你能用你的脑子"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 36,
      "start_ms": 80000,
      "end_ms": 83340,
      "text": "相信还有那个就是徒步啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 37,
      "start_ms": 83340,
      "end_ms": 86660,
      "text": "徒步就是这个城市里面的找一个景点去走路"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 38,
      "start_ms": 86660,
      "end_ms": 88240,
      "text": "徒步啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 39,
      "start_ms": 88240,
      "end_ms": 89480,
      "text": "20块钱包接送啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 40,
      "start_ms": 89480,
      "end_ms": 91060,
      "text": "还要包这个饮水和小吃"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 41,
      "start_ms": 91060,
      "end_ms": 95140,
      "text": "然后晚上是那个游这个石湖公园啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 42,
      "start_ms": 95140,
      "end_ms": 96240,
      "text": "这个是第一天的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 43,
      "start_ms": 96240,
      "end_ms": 97780,
      "text": "就是也是两个徒步的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 44,
      "start_ms": 97780,
      "end_ms": 100100,
      "text": "还有一个是种小树苗的嘛"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 45,
      "start_ms": 100340,
      "end_ms": 104190,
      "text": "然后那个10月2号会有一个非常小规模"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 46,
      "start_ms": 104190,
      "end_ms": 106750,
      "text": "极小规模的一个小的一个运动会"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 47,
      "start_ms": 106750,
      "end_ms": 108950,
      "text": "就就是一些一起去跑跑步啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 48,
      "start_ms": 108950,
      "end_ms": 111100,
      "text": "跳远什么拔拔河什么东西的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 49,
      "start_ms": 111100,
      "end_ms": 115640,
      "text": "还会那个在店里面会欢迎新新新加入的会员啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 50,
      "start_ms": 115640,
      "end_ms": 117940,
      "text": "然后还会有就是派对"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 51,
      "start_ms": 117940,
      "end_ms": 119600,
      "text": "就是吃东西就这么简单啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 52,
      "start_ms": 119600,
      "end_ms": 125039,
      "text": "然后那个第三天的话会有那个厨艺"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 53,
      "start_ms": 125039,
      "end_ms": 126759,
      "text": "就是你在这里吃饭"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 54,
