    {
      "ordinal": 73,
      "start_ms": 163380,
      "end_ms": 164460,
      "text": "其实就是一样的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 74,
      "start_ms": 164460,
      "end_ms": 165420,
      "text": "就是晚上吃饭的时候"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 75,
      "start_ms": 165420,
      "end_ms": 168290,
      "text": "他们聊天就是没没活可硬扯"
