      "text": "其实就是你愿意跑5km吗"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 105,
      "start_ms": 221390,
      "end_ms": 222350,
      "text": "我就开车带你过去"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 106,
      "start_ms": 222350,
      "end_ms": 224170,
