    {
      "ordinal": 118,
      "start_ms": 248354,
      "end_ms": 251609,
      "text": "跟着王大厨学做菜"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 119,
      "start_ms": 252760,
      "end_ms": 255760,
      "text": "又是他妈的巴顿就是没没东西可可凑的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 120,
      "start_ms": 255760,
      "end_ms": 256380,
      "text": "你知道吗"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 121,
      "start_ms": 256380,
      "end_ms": 259500,
      "text": "就是搞一个是什么王大厨做菜的时候在旁边"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 122,
      "start_ms": 259500,
      "end_ms": 260600,
      "text": "你可以在旁边看"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 123,
      "start_ms": 260600,
      "end_ms": 262120,
      "text": "就是跟王大厨学做菜"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 124,
      "start_ms": 262120,
      "end_ms": 264870,
      "text": "没办法"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 125,
      "start_ms": 264870,
      "end_ms": 266410,
      "text": "就跟着王大厨学做菜"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 126,
      "start_ms": 266410,
      "end_ms": 267940,
      "text": "他就对"
    },
    {
